      "side": 1,
      "message": "Who writes build-globs.ninja?\nI think this file is currently written during RunBlueprint, and this CL will move it to bootstrapBlueprint. bpglob does not write to this file, bpglob writes to the globs themselves (e.g. out/soong/.primary/globs/0)\n\nCan we remove it from Blueprint?\nsoong_ui invokes bootstrapBlueprint https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/ui/build/soong.go;l\u003d214;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1, which itself invokes RunBlueprint. By this stage, a .bootstrap/build.ninja is generated. We need to create a .bootstrap/build-globs.ninja before running the bootstrap rule https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/ui/build/soong.go;l\u003d295;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1\n\nDo we need to create a soong/build-globs.ninja?\nUnlike soong/.bootstrap/build.ninja, soong/build.ninja does not include a glob file using the subninja keyword. This is because it is generated during StageMain, and AddSubninja is skipped due to this if clause https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/blueprint/bootstrap/bootstrap.go;l\u003d745?q\u003dAddSubninja%20f:build%2Fbluep\nSo we do not need to create soong/build-globs.ninja file",
